	[Tooltip("Noots is a unit, in addition to Meters and Pixels, useful for resolution-independent sizing
A noot is proportional to the shortest dimension of your resolution (note: this is unrelated to physical size)

Converting noots to pixels:
min(res.x,res.y)*(noots/NAS)
res = screen resolution
NAS = noots across screen

You can specify how big a single noot is here, though, I recommended leaving it at the default value of 100

1 = 1 noot is 100% of the screen
50 = 1 noot is 50% of the screen
100 = 1 noot is 1% of the screen (default)
(100 is like vmin in CSS)")]
