	[Tooltip("Material to apply to the mesh colliders. If you need more granular control for materials on what bones youll need to add a RASCALProperties component to the bone transform or skinned-mesh transform. The priority goes from highest to lowest: Material-Association-List -> Bone-Transform -> SkinnedMesh-Transform -> PhysicsMaterial-Variable")]
